<title>HUNGARY: TABLE-OTP H1 net profit up at HUF 9.13bln.</title>
<headline>TABLE-OTP H1 net profit up at HUF 9.13bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				    Jan-June 1997    Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit   12,887.0     vs    8,737.8</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit     11,269.8     vs    6,671.2</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit    9,131.2     vs    5,069.4</p>
